# HOME's knob pages: ALGO there steps MIX, SPACE, MOTION, ALIVE, TONE (round and round; kept across a power
# cut), the knobs each page's, drawn as arcs (screenshots in build/scenarios/home_pages/)
autoplay 0
wait 500
expect hpage 0
shot mix.png
# MIX: the parts' levels (VOX's: the sound playing's)
turn K1 -5
expect shape10 90
turn K4 3
turn ALGO 1
expect hpage 1
expect view 0
shot space.png
# SPACE: the reverb's return, its decay, shimmer, the delay's return (the FX page's)
turn K3 5
expect fx2 35
turn ALGO 1
expect hpage 2
# MOTION: the tempo first
turn K1 6
expect set_bpm 96
turn K3 4
expect shape13 >0
shot motion.png
turn ALGO 1
expect hpage 3
# ALIVE: steps; SWELLS how many drone voices come and go (all five in ECLIPSE: down to two, the top two)
turn K3 -3
expect dswell 24
turn K4 2
expect travel 2
shot alive.png
turn ALGO 1
expect hpage 4
shot tone.png
turn ALGO 1
expect hpage 0
turn ALGO -2
expect hpage 3
tap SAVE
powercut
wait 300
expect hpage 3
expect travel 2
expect dswell 24
